#: scenes/welcome/welcome.tscn
msgid "Editing in GoZen"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/welcome/welcome.tscn
msgid ""
"The editing process is quite straight forward due to the minimalistic UI and "
"functionality. There are some shortcuts to be aware of to make your editing "
"more comfortable and the default position of those  shortcuts make it "
"possible to keep your left hand on your keyboard and right hand on your "
"mouse. Ergonomics are important."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/welcome/welcome.tscn
msgid "Timeline mode shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/welcome/welcome.tscn
